# Neiro VPS Cron Job Configuration
# Add to crontab via `crontab -e` on your VPS.
# Define NEIRO_URL and DASHBOARD_SECRET at the top or replace directly in the command:
# NEIRO_URL=https://your-neiro-app.vercel.app
# DASHBOARD_SECRET=your-secure-dashboard-secret

* * * * * curl -fsS -m 55 -X POST "$NEIRO_URL/api/orchestrator/tick" -H "Authorization: Bearer $DASHBOARD_SECRET" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{}' >/dev/null 2>&1
